DESCRIPTION:Al-Qadisiyah University Photo Gallery Explore the university campus and facilities through our photo gallery.\nUniversity Buildings Main Gate Photo of Al-Qadisiyah University&rsquo;s main gate welcoming visitors and students.\nAdministrative Building Main building housing university administration and presidency.\nCentral Library Central library containing thousands of books and scientific references.\nScientific Laboratories College of Medicine Labs Modern laboratories equipped for medical student training.\nCollege of Engineering Labs Advanced engineering workshops and laboratories.\nCollege of Science Labs Chemistry, physics, and biology laboratories.\nLecture Halls Modern Lecture Halls Halls equipped with the latest presentation and educational technology.\nConference Halls Large halls for hosting conferences and scientific seminars.\nSports Facilities Sports Fields Football, basketball, and volleyball fields.\nIndoor Gyms Indoor facilities for various sports activities.\nEvents and Activities Graduation Ceremonies Photos from annual graduation ceremonies.\nScientific Conferences Snapshots from conferences and scientific seminars.\nStudent Activities Cultural, sports, and artistic student activities.\nGreen Spaces University Gardens Green spaces and gardens within the university campus.\nNote: The gallery will be updated with high-quality photos soon.\nTo contribute photos or request official photos:\nmedia@qu.edu.iq 
